{"unit_id":"LinHyu-2006__dsh-balance-hud#feature-4","repo":"LinHyu-2006/dsh-balance-hud","commit":"bd489d9060bfc0af76b4244c56e95bac123df422","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-balance-hud 的功能「官方价格同步」：用户可在设置中手动同步，或选定间隔自动读取 DeepSeek 官方价格页；解析失败时保留现有价格表。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:2921-2942","lib/index.js:159-166"]}
{"unit_id":"LinHyu-2006__dsh-balance-hud#caveat-1","repo":"LinHyu-2006/dsh-balance-hud","commit":"bd489d9060bfc0af76b4244c56e95bac123df422","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-balance-hud 默认不向外请求；手动同步或启用自动同步后，Host 才读取 api-docs.deepseek.com 的公开价格页，页面内容不含用户余额或会话数据。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:159-166","lib/client.js:2921-2942"]}
